id: monster-form-monstrous-ascension
name: Monstrous Ascension
order: 1
slot: trait
# Its [Permanent] effects: they hold outside the Transformation too.
permanent: 1
# (1) A Monstrous Trait and a Bestial Trait, chosen as it is gained, had while it is.
grantsOther: monstrous, bestial
description: >
  Your transformation into your monstrous persona has many benefits, allowing your strength to grow in many unexpected ways.
text: >
  Monstrous Ascension: Your transformation into your monstrous persona has many benefits, allowing your strength to grow in many unexpected ways.
  (1)-[Permanent, Passive]: Upon gaining access to this Transformation:
  • Choose an Attribute (AG/TE or FO+MA). Increase the Attribute Modifier Bonus of that Attribute(s) by 1(T).
  • Choose an Aspect: High Speed, Bulky, or Raging. This Transformation gains your chosen Aspect.
  • Choose 2 Saving Throws. This Transformation gains the Enhanced Save Aspect for those Saving Throws.
  • Choose a Monstrous Trait to gain access to while in this Transformation.
  • Choose a Bestial Trait to gain access to while in this Transformation.
  • Choose between 0~3 levels of the Growth Aspect. This Transformation gains those levels of that Aspect.
  • Choose between 0~2 levels of the Rampaging Aspect. This Transformation gains those levels of that Aspect.
  (2)-[Passive]: Increase the amount of Life and Ki Points you regain through Legend Realized by 1/2 of the Attribute Modifier for the Attribute you chose through the first effect of Monstrous Ascension.
  (3)-[Passive]: For each level of the Rampaging Aspect this Transformation possesses, increase your Soak Value and Wound Rolls by 1(T).
  (4)-[Passive]: Depending on the Aspect you chose through the first effect of Monstrous Ascension, gain access to one of the following effects:
  • High Speed [Triggered, 1/Round]: If you use an Attacking Maneuver, and have used the Movement Maneuver this Combat Round to move your full Boosted Speed, increase the Wound Roll of that Attacking Maneuver by 1/2 of your Boosted Speed.
  • Bulky [Passive]: While you possess up to 2 stacks of Super Stack, increase your Strike Rolls by 1(T).
  • Raging [Passive]: This Transformation gains the Innate State (Raging) Aspect.

---

# (1) The Attribute, the Aspect, the Saves, Growth and Rampaging chosen, (2)-(4): the table's.
